//! Integration test server for the {{stinger.name}} interface.
//!
//! Unlike server_demo.rs, this is not meant to run forever: it emits every
//! signal on a short interval, validates every method call/command/property
//! update it receives against the value client_integration_test is expected
//! to send, prints one `[CHECK] <name> ... PASS|FAIL` line per thing it
//! validates, then a final `RESULT: PASS|FAIL (n/m checks)` line, and exits -
//! 0 if every check passed, 1 otherwise. It stops on its own once every
//! expected check has come in, or after MAX_LIFETIME_SECONDS, whichever is
//! first, so it never has to be killed by hand.
//!
//! Start this first, then run client_integration_test (same broker) in
//! another process.

